<title>JAPAN: NCB to issue statement on tieup with Bankers Trust.</title>
<headline>NCB to issue statement on tieup with Bankers Trust.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd will issue a statement on a business tie-up plan with Bankers Trust New York Corp at 9.30 a.m. (0030 GMT), an NCB spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The spokesman did not give other details.</p>
<p>An NCB official earlier told Reuters that the bank, in the course of a restructuring, was in the &quot;final stages&quot; of talks on a business tie-up with Bankers Trust.</p>
</text>
